# integrate ... numerically qmc: Owen's nested uniform scrambling (owen)
# beside the digital shift
#
# a smooth integrand: the shift's standard error falls about like 1/n,
# the scrambling's like n^-1.5 (sixteen times the points: 17 and 56
# times smaller); the value is sum 1/((k+1)^2 k!) = 1.3179021514...
g(x: real in 0..1, y: real in 0..1) = exp(x * y)
integrate g numerically qmc points 1024 replicates 16
integrate g numerically qmc points 1024 replicates 16 owen
integrate g numerically qmc points 16384 replicates 16
integrate g numerically qmc points 16384 replicates 16 owen
# the two do not go together
integrate x^2 from 0 to 1 numerically qmc owen noscramble
